---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Policies"
description: "Uncost's governance policies — public review drafts. Not adopted or in force; publication is not adoption."
pageId: "policies"
---
{% from "partials/content-needed.njk" import block as gap %}
<section class="blk blk--first">
  <p class="eyebrow">Policies</p>
  <h1 class="sec">Governance, in the open.</h1>
  <p class="lead">{{ catalog.counts.policiesDrafted }} public review drafts, plus {{ catalog.counts.policiesReserved }} reserved reference number{% if catalog.counts.policiesReserved != 1 %}s{% endif %} held for policies not yet written. Nothing here is adopted or in force — publication is not adoption. Each draft is published so it can be reviewed before it is ever activated.</p>
</section>
<section class="blk blk--cream2">
  <div class="pollist">
{%- for policy in catalog.policies %}
    <a class="polrow" href="/policies/{{ policy.slug }}/"><span class="pid">{{ policy.id }}</span><span>{{ policy.display }}</span><span class="status status--planned">{% if policy.reserved %}Not yet drafted{% else %}Draft{% endif %}</span></a>
{%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="prose-60">The consolidated policy pack is maintained in the public repository: <a href="https://github.com/uncost-org/uncost/blob/main/policies/POLICY-PACK-v1.3.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Policy Pack v1.3</a>.</p>
</section>
